# Telos, the Czerka site (TSL, 233TEL): the sentry droid and the mercenary
# behind her mines, the base camp's mercenaries (they would collect our
# bounty: fought), the landing pad's turrets and guards, its console (Bao-
# Dur finds no ship but a blip on the power grid, and a shuttle in the
# military base), the last mercenaries by the mined entrance, and into the
# old military base. Starts from the Restoration Zone's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_czerka_site data/routes/tsl/telos_czerka_site.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Czerka Excavation Site" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
fight 30             # the sentry droid ahead
to 233_mercdm_talk   # the mercenary behind her mines, and her droids
talk
fight 30
to 233_mercc_talk    # the base camp: the mercenaries talk, then fight
talk
fight 40
use padpanel         # the landing pad's console (its turrets and guards
talk                 # fought on the way); its scene leaves Bao-Dur leading
use MilLowPlstcCylin # (tr_baodurpad's SetPartyLeader) until the military
                     # base's first entry gives the Exile back (k_232_enter's
                     # SetPartyLeader(NPC_PLAYER) for GetFirstPC, the one led);
                     # the pad's plasteel container
fight 40             # down the ramp: the mercenaries left by the mined
use MilHighPlstcCylin # entrance; its container
exit to_232TEL       # into the old military base
module 232tel
save telos_military_base
